Did you give the whole box to the robot?

Did you figure out a how to train the robot so that the zero
keeps getting bigger?

Did you try to train the robot to copy the 1 and drop it on the zero?

Did you give the box to the robot after training him and then
erase the zero?

Well, what I would do is give the whole box to the robot.  Then I'd
have the robot copy the 1 and drop the result on the zero.  I'd give
the box back to the robot again and wait for Dusty to appear.  I'd
erase the 0 and give the robot the box again.  Then I'd stand up
for a few seconds to give the robot a chance to count up to 1000.  Then
I'd sit down and pick up the whole box.

